{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1000_p", "source_sha256": "aed95b2544c36b02c1c17e81729f4d99ec002a141cfdff42f7239e91832a9a88", "ja": "星梨花。ブログ読ませてもらったよ\n星梨花らしくて、とてもいい内容だったと思う。", "zh": "星梨花。我读了你的博客\n我觉得内容很有星梨花的风格，非常棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "3827584ef66104c0266263802879e3db442cf7c55046096856af341d030d5ea8", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございます！\nえへへ、がんばって書いたから、うれしいです♪", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢您！\n嘿嘿，因为我认真写了，所以特别开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9a9f0cc221d1c55ae556ba074a5725a40aa2f0e0db9e240b8e8d5d53a2c3ccc9", "ja": "もうコメントもついてたぞ。ええと……\n「星梨花ちゃん、頑張って！」だって。", "zh": "已经有人评论了哦。我想想……\n写着“星梨花，要加油哦！”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d91ab80773efe705cc3792c8039899e2be2af7421ec2c1d1b2b6fb02f135fe16", "ja": "えっ？\n……って、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？\n……我是说，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "a156675d541f066d9656a029630355e4ec6a4165daa5694013ab39b73c0f672c", "ja": "あの……わたし、みなさんを応援したいって\n思ってたのに……応援されちゃってるんですか？", "zh": "那个……明明我是想着要为大家\n加油的……结果反而被大家加油了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1006_p", "source_sha256": "def207930d8ed029ef80599ec2c6a39a4a2d3c3968145244b0e8bab7040f4081", "ja": "あ、なるほど。\nそうだな……でも、それは仕方ないかな？", "zh": "啊，原来如此。\n这么说来……不过，那也是没办法的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "dc5f4c2d148c5b91a565852368c056e7824f10989c6a550b1339908a6f798d03", "ja": "えっ、どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦，为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b15103444fe907b4d20f6257dcc9026338104d4b45251d1080e58192b136d420", "ja": "みんな本当に、星梨花の応援が嬉しかったんだよ。\nだから、もっと応援してほしいんだと思うな。", "zh": "大家真的都很高兴能得到星梨花的支持哦。\n所以，我想他们是希望你能为他们加更多油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "391382efb49ea6069bcff91f1b3296ac55ceca978c317d3ad50c655ce9e7f92b", "ja": "あっ、それでがんばってって……。\nよかった、そうなんですね。わかりました！", "zh": "啊，原来是因为这样才让我加油啊……  \n太好了，原来如此。我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "565637bf143e5105525aed6bf09350847ad125da325be142dd6f63fe715a018e", "ja": "それじゃあ、これからもっとたくさんの人を、\nたくさん応援できるように……。", "zh": "那么，接下来为了能为更多的人、\n为大家加油……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "77208ee8b65897f4d4fedde52adfc8d7a98e83e5394f72fd4ec54d04d934cca6", "ja": "ちゃんと大切なものを見つけて、届けられる……\nそんな立派なアイドルになれるように、がんばります♪", "zh": "我会努力成为能够找到真正重要的东西，并将它传递出去的优秀偶像♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c70d9b61207e37fe2a2f6c7b62474855d782a8647db674c951777e6a28e10f6a", "ja": "ああ、これからも一緒に、ゆっくり探していこうな！", "zh": "啊，今后也一起慢慢寻找吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "0b44f60fe6b1cf1178f287c07930d377f0ea0782cb19a26c486ce21ada3cea64", "ja": "はい、{$P$}さんと一緒に、\nこれからゆっくり……ゆっくり……。", "zh": "是的，和{$P$}先生一起，\n接下来慢慢地……慢慢地……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_069_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_069_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "2ef3f10d6543f7f83e870d3c7e49fd99013caa00179548f443c0491805874240", "ja": "不思議です。早く見つけたいのに、ゆっくりな方が\nうれしい気がします。どうしてでしょう……？", "zh": "真奇怪。明明想早点找到，却觉得慢慢来反而更开心。这是为什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
